OL,3,AFamily of British explorer Sir Ranulph
OL,4,AFiennes say they don't know where he is
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise Millington-Cotes did not
OL,7,Fimmediately respond to the allegations,
OL,8,For the BBC's request for comment.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
