OL,3,AEvicted Spanish pensioner can move back
OL,4,Ahome, lawyer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn evicted elderly disabled woman, who
OL,7,Fbecame symbolic of Spain's housing
OL,8,Fcrisis, will be able to return to her
OL,9,Fhome in Madrid, according to her
OL,10,Flawyer.
OL,12,FMaricarmen Abascal, 87, was forcibly
OL,13,Fremoved on a stretcher from her
OL,14,Fapartment of more than 70 years on 23
OL,15,FSeptember. She was admitted to hospital
OL,16,Fafter the eviction.
OL,18,FThe eviction has led to widespread
OL,19,Fanger across Spain, and Prime Minister
OL,20,FPedro Sanchez has promised housing
OL,21,Frelief measures when his cabinet meets
OL,22,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
